Origin: backport, https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/series/173155/
From: Xiao Lu <xiaolu.xie@intel.com>
Subject: drm/i915/display: Enable VRR/HDR over MST (Ubuntu 7.0 backport)
Message-Id: <20260902051206.264215-1-xiaolu.xie@intel.com>

Rebase Xiao Lu v6 onto Ubuntu 7.0.0-38.38 and include Gil Dekel v3 1/2
per-connector colorimetry capability handling. See patches/README.md for
Ubuntu API adaptations and the differences from the original submissions.

---

